{
  "part": "ch02",
  "id": "annotations",
  "title": "标注与装饰",
  "partTitle": "基础图形",
  "prev": {
    "part": "ch02",
    "id": "boolean-ops",
    "title": "布尔运算",
    "path": "/ch/ch02/boolean-ops"
  },
  "next": {
    "part": "ch02",
    "id": "images-and-svg",
    "title": "位图与 SVG",
    "path": "/ch/ch02/images-and-svg"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>本节覆盖“给已有内容加标注”的一族工具：包围框、背景框、叉号、下划线、标签、大括号。它们大多不改变被标注对象本身，而是作为独立的 mobject 叠加在画面上。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "SurroundingRectangle",
      "text": "SurroundingRectangle"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>SurroundingRectangle</code> 画一个紧贴目标外围的矩形框，是最常用的强调手段。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>*mobjects</code>",
          "type": "Mobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "被包围的对象（多个时取整体包围盒）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>color</code>",
          "type": "ParsableManimColor",
          "default": "YELLOW",
          "desc": "框线颜色"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float \\",
          "default": "tuple[float, float]",
          "desc": "0.1"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>corner_radius</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.0",
          "desc": "圆角半径；大于 0 时边角变圆"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "SurroundingRectangle",
        "RoundedRectangle",
        "Rectangle",
        "Polygon",
        "VMobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：矩形框是<strong>静态快照</strong>——目标随后移动时框不会跟随，需要配合 updater 或每帧重算。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "BackgroundRectangle",
      "text": "BackgroundRectangle"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>BackgroundRectangle</code> 画一个填充的“背景垫”，常垫在文字下方提高可读性。继承 <code>SurroundingRectangle</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>*mobjects</code>",
          "type": "Mobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "被垫底的对象"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>color</code>",
          "type": "ParsableManimColor \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "描边宽度（默认无）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>fill_opacity</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.75",
          "desc": "填充不透明度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float \\",
          "default": "tuple[float, float]",
          "desc": "0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：在浅背景上把 <code>color</code> 留 None 会得到“背景色垫”，等于隐形；需要深色垫时显式传 <code>color=BLACK</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Cross",
      "text": "Cross"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Cross</code> 在目标位置画一个“X”形叉号，表示否定、删除或错误。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>mobject</code>",
          "type": "Mobject \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_color</code>",
          "type": "ParsableManimColor",
          "default": "<h1>FC6255</h1>",
          "desc": "叉号线颜色"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "6.0",
          "desc": "线宽"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>scale_factor</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "1.0",
          "desc": "相对目标尺寸的缩放"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "Cross",
        "VGroup"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常见坑：<code>Cross</code> 是一个 <code>VGroup</code>（两条线），对它整体 <code>set_color</code> 只影响默认色，若已显式传过 <code>stroke_color</code> 需要 <code>set_stroke</code> 修改。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Underline",
      "text": "Underline"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Underline</code> 在目标正下方画一条下划线，继承 <code>Line</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>mobject</code>",
          "type": "Mobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "被划线的对象"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.1",
          "desc": "线与目标底边的间距"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">underline = Underline(formula, buff=0.15, color=BLUE)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Label",
      "text": "Label"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Label</code> 是 v0.21 标签三件套（<code>Label</code> / <code>LabeledLine</code> / <code>LabeledArrow</code> / <code>LabeledPolygram</code>）的基类：一个文本外加背景垫与边框组成的 <code>VGroup</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>label</code>",
          "type": "str \\",
          "default": "ManimTextLabel",
          "desc": "—"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>box_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>frame_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">Label(&quot;x+y&quot;, label_config={&quot;font_size&quot;: 36})\nLabel(Text(&quot;速度&quot;, font_size=36), box_config={&quot;fill_opacity&quot;: 0})\n</code></pre>\n<p>常用属性：<code>label.rendered_label</code>（文本本体）、<code>label.background_rect</code>（背景垫）、<code>label.frame</code>（边框）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "LabeledLine",
      "text": "LabeledLine"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>带标签的线段：标签沿线段按 <code>label_position</code> 比例定位。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>label</code>",
          "type": "str \\",
          "default": "ManimTextLabel",
          "desc": "—"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label_position</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.5",
          "desc": "标签在线段上的比例位置，0 起点、1 终点"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>box_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>frame_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>*args, **kwargs</code>",
          "type": "Any",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "其余参数同 <code>Line</code>（<code>start</code>、<code>end</code>、<code>color</code> 等）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">LabeledLine(label=&quot;a&quot;, label_position=0.3, start=LEFT * 3, end=RIGHT * 3)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "LabeledLine",
        "Line",
        "TipableVMobject",
        "VMobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "LabeledArrow",
      "text": "LabeledArrow"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>LabeledArrow</code> 多重继承 <code>LabeledLine</code> 与 <code>Arrow</code>：既是一根带箭头尖的线，又带沿线定位的标签。参数同 <code>LabeledLine</code>，可直接传 <code>Text</code> 实例作标签。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">LabeledArrow(label=Text(&quot;v&quot;, font_size=36), start=LEFT, end=RIGHT)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "LabeledArrow",
        "LabeledLine",
        "Line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "LabeledPolygram",
      "text": "LabeledPolygram"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>LabeledPolygram</code> 在任意多边形（<code>Polygram</code>）中心放置标签。标签位置不是简单的几何中心，而是多边形的<strong>不可达极点</strong>（pole of inaccessibility，距离所有边最远的内点），对凹多边形也能把标签放在“最深处”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>*vertex_groups</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike_Array",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "顶点组，同 <code>Polygram</code>（每组自动首尾闭合）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label</code>",
          "type": "str \\",
          "default": "ManimTextLabel",
          "desc": "—"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>precision</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.01",
          "desc": "极点求解精度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常用属性：<code>poly.pole</code>（极点坐标）、<code>poly.radius</code>（极点到边界的最小距离）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/annotations_demo",
      "scene": "AnnotationsDemo",
      "caption": "<p><code>SurroundingRectangle</code> / <code>BackgroundRectangle</code> / <code>Underline</code> 强调公式，<code>Cross</code> 表示否定后消失；下方依次是 <code>LabeledLine</code>（标签在 30% 处）、<code>LabeledArrow</code>（Text 标签）与 <code>LabeledPolygram</code>（标签位于三角形极点）。</p>",
      "code": "\"\"\"AnnotationsDemo: SurroundingRectangle / BackgroundRectangle / Cross / Underline / Label / LabeledLine / LabeledArrow / LabeledPolygram.\"\"\"\n\nfrom manim import *\n\n\nclass AnnotationsDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        formula = MathTex(\"e^{i\\\\pi} + 1 = 0\", font_size=48)\n        box = SurroundingRectangle(formula, color=YELLOW, buff=0.2, corner_radius=0.1)\n        bg = BackgroundRectangle(formula, color=BLACK, fill_opacity=0.8, buff=0.1)\n        under = Underline(formula, color=BLUE, buff=0.15)\n\n        self.play(Write(formula))\n        self.play(FadeIn(bg), Create(box), Create(under))\n\n        cross_target = Cross(formula.copy(), stroke_color=RED)\n        self.play(Write(cross_target))\n        self.play(FadeOut(cross_target), run_time=0.5)\n\n        line = LabeledLine(\n            label=\"a\",\n            label_position=0.3,\n            label_config={\"font_size\": 36},\n            start=LEFT * 5 + DOWN * 2,\n            end=LEFT * 2 + DOWN * 2.5,\n        )\n        arrow = LabeledArrow(\n            label=Text(\"v\", font_size=36),\n            start=RIGHT * 0.5 + DOWN * 2,\n            end=RIGHT * 3 + DOWN * 1,\n        )\n        poly = LabeledPolygram(\n            [LEFT * 1.2, RIGHT * 1.2, UP * 1.2 + RIGHT * 0.4],\n            label=\"\\\\Delta\",\n            color=WHITE,\n        ).shift(DOWN * 0.3 + RIGHT * 4.2)\n\n        self.play(Create(line), Create(arrow), Create(poly))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "Brace",
      "text": "Brace"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>Brace</code> 在一侧画一个大括号 <code>{</code>，常用于标注长度、配文字说明。它继承 <code>VMobjectFromSVGPath</code>——内部把大括号当作一段 SVG 路径解析。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>mobject</code>",
          "type": "Mobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "被标注的对象"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>direction</code>",
          "type": "Vector3DLike",
          "default": "[0, -1, 0]",
          "desc": "大括号开口朝向（默认向下）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.2",
          "desc": "与目标的间距"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>sharpness</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "2",
          "desc": "大括号的尖锐程度"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>stroke_width</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0",
          "desc": "描边宽度（默认纯填充）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>fill_opacity</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "1.0",
          "desc": "填充不透明度"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>配套方法：<code>brace.get_text(\"...\")</code>、<code>brace.get_tex(\"...\")</code> 可快速生成放在大括号旁的文字。</p>\n<p>常见坑：大括号不会随目标自动伸缩——目标尺寸变化后需要重新构造 <code>Brace</code> 或手动 <code>brace.scale_to_fit_width(...)</code>；<code>get_text</code>/<code>get_tex</code> 返回的文字也要自己 <code>next_to(brace, ...)</code> 定位。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "BraceBetweenPoints",
      "text": "BraceBetweenPoints"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>BraceBetweenPoints</code> 在两个点之间画大括号，不用先有 mobject。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>point_1</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "起点"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>point_2</code>",
          "type": "Point3DLike",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "终点"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>direction</code>",
          "type": "Vector3DLike",
          "default": "[0, 0, 0]",
          "desc": "开口方向；零向量时自动取垂直方向"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "inheritance",
      "chain": [
        "BraceBetweenPoints",
        "Brace",
        "VMobjectFromSVGPath",
        "VMobject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "BraceLabel",
      "text": "BraceLabel"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>BraceLabel</code> 是“大括号 + 文字”的组合：构造后文字自动放在大括号外侧。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>obj</code>",
          "type": "Mobject",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "被标注的对象"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>text</code>",
          "type": "str",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "标注文字"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>brace_direction</code>",
          "type": "Vector3DLike",
          "default": "[0, -1, 0]",
          "desc": "大括号开口方向"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>label_constructor</code>",
          "type": "type",
          "default": "MathTex",
          "desc": "文字构造器（<code>MathTex</code> 或 <code>Text</code>）"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>font_size</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "48",
          "desc": "文字字号"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>buff</code>",
          "type": "float",
          "default": "0.2",
          "desc": "文字与大括号的间距"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>brace_config</code>",
          "type": "dict \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>常用属性：<code>bl.brace</code>（大括号）、<code>bl.label</code>（文字）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "BraceText",
      "text": "BraceText"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>BraceText</code> 继承 <code>BraceLabel</code>，唯一区别是 <code>label_constructor</code> 默认是 <code>Text</code> 而非 <code>MathTex</code>——标注纯文本时少写一个参数。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">BraceText(rectangle, &quot;width = 4&quot;)            # 用 Text 渲染\nBraceLabel(rectangle, &quot;w=4&quot;)                 # 用 MathTex 渲染\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "ArcBrace",
      "text": "ArcBrace"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><code>ArcBrace</code> 沿一段 <code>Arc</code> 画大括号（常用于标注角度或弧长），继承 <code>Brace</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "params",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "<code>arc</code>",
          "type": "Arc \\",
          "default": "None",
          "desc": "None"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>direction</code>",
          "type": "Vector3DLike",
          "default": "[1, 0, 0]",
          "desc": "大括号整体朝向"
        },
        {
          "name": "<code>**kwargs</code>",
          "type": "Any",
          "default": "—",
          "desc": "其余参数同 <code>Brace</code>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-python\">arc = Arc(radius=1.5, start_angle=PI / 4, angle=PI / 2)\narc_brace = ArcBrace(arc)\n</code></pre>"
    },
    {
      "type": "demo",
      "example": "ch02/braces_demo",
      "scene": "BracesDemo",
      "caption": "<p>上方是 <code>Brace</code> + <code>BraceText</code> 标注矩形宽度；左下是 <code>BraceBetweenPoints</code> 与 <code>BraceLabel</code>（MathTex 标签）标注两点间距离；右下是 <code>ArcBrace</code> 标注圆弧。</p>",
      "code": "\"\"\"BracesDemo: Brace / BraceBetweenPoints / BraceLabel / BraceText / ArcBrace.\"\"\"\n\nfrom manim import *\n\n\nclass BracesDemo(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        obj = Rectangle(width=4, height=1.5, color=BLUE)\n        obj.shift(UP * 1.5)\n        self.play(Create(obj))\n\n        brace = Brace(obj, direction=DOWN)\n        brace_text = BraceText(obj, \"width = 4\", label_constructor=Text, font_size=30)\n        self.play(GrowFromCenter(brace), Write(brace_text))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n\n        p1 = LEFT * 5 + DOWN * 2\n        p2 = LEFT * 2 + DOWN * 3\n        points_brace = BraceBetweenPoints(p1, p2, direction=RIGHT)\n        points_line = Line(p1, p2)\n        points_label = BraceLabel(\n            Line(p1, p2),\n            \"\\\\sqrt{10}\",\n            brace_direction=RIGHT,\n            font_size=30,\n        )\n\n        arc = Arc(radius=1.2, start_angle=PI / 4, angle=PI / 2).shift(RIGHT * 3 + DOWN * 1.5)\n        arc_brace = ArcBrace(arc)\n\n        self.play(Create(points_line), GrowFromCenter(points_brace), Write(points_label))\n        self.play(Create(arc), GrowFromCenter(arc_brace))\n        self.wait(0.5)\n",
      "video": null
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "id": "常见错误与建议",
      "text": "常见错误与建议"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "warning",
      "title": "常见错误",
      "html": "<p>所有标注类都是<strong>独立 mobject</strong>，不会跟随目标。给移动中的目标加框请用 updater：<code>box.add_updater(lambda b: b.become(SurroundingRectangle(target)))</code>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "level": "tip",
